                        <collation>
                          <note>Quire descriptions: protection quire and quires 1–13 balanced. Navigation system: green thread sewn into the fore edge of <locus target="#109" facs="113"/> to mark content.</note>
                          <list>
                              <item xml:id="q1" n="a">
